# Needs the dev test stock (TST). Notices (priority 1): a limit buy that fills is chirped by City
# Brokerage. Notices are muted in tests; this scenario switches them on to check one chirp. The
# shares bought are sold back in cleanup.
name notices: a filled limit buy is chirped in Chirper by City Brokerage
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-buy TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 5
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 95
click Button
close-dialog
expect-orders-delta 1
notices on
set-price TST 90
run-days 1
wait 1
expect-owned-delta TST 5
expect-log notices: chirped [City Brokerage] Limit buy filled: bought 5 TST at ₡90 (limit ₡95) for ₡450. #orders
capture fill-notice
cleanup:
notices off
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 5
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
